   "mech": [
    "A continuous beam. Damage starts low and builds while the beam stays on one target, reaching full strength after the focus time. Switching targets resets it.",
    "Beams drain capacitor every second they fire. No ammo to reload; beam crystals wear out slowly instead.",
    "Hard edge: a very short falloff, so damage stops almost dead past optimal. Tracking is the weakest of the turrets: up close the beam slides off a crossing target."
   ],
