   "mech": [
    "Fast-firing cartridge guns. No capacitor use at all.",
    "Every shot can crit for double damage. Short optimal range with a long falloff: damage fades gradually instead of stopping.",
    "Highest raw damage of the four systems, but the barrels need a moment to spin up and the mounts are heavy to fit.",
    "Best tracking of any turret, so it keeps hitting well inside its band. Magazines are big but reloads are a real gap in damage."
   ],
